      "contentHtml": "<div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #f1f3f5; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n\n  <!-- 頂部吸睛標題輪播感 (選一即可，此處整合呈現) -->\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #6b1124; margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 1.25em; font-weight: bold;\">\n      🍷 歡聚微醺，不收開瓶費！自帶愛酒最划算\n    </h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #b89742; margin: 0; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500;\">\n      ✨ 實現美酒自由！平假日自帶酒水免開瓶費\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 主內文區塊 -->\n  <div style=\"background-color: #fcf9f2; border-left: 4px solid #b89742; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.05em;\">😎 <strong>歡聚微醺，美酒自由！自帶酒類 #免開瓶費</strong></div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #6b1124; font-weight: bold;\">📅 誠意滿滿！平假日、不限時段皆有效</div>\n    <div style=\"color: #555; font-size: 0.95em;\">✨ 帶上您最愛的珍藏佳釀，來這裡配美食最對味！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 安全宣導與溫馨提醒 -->\n  <div style=\"background-color: #fff5f5; border: 1px solid #ffc9c9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color: #c92a2a; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: bold;\">\n      ⚠️ 溫馨提醒\n    </h4>\n    <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 0.95em;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; color: #c92a2a; font-weight: bold;\">✅ 未成年請勿飲酒 🔞</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; color: #495057;\">✅ 飲酒過量，有害健康</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; color: #c92a2a; font-weight: bold;\">✅ 酒後請勿駕車，安全至上 🚗</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n"
