      "contentHtml": "<!-- 美樂地 KTV 優惠方案區段 開始 -->\n<style>\n    .ktv-promo-container * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-container {\n        --bg-color: #0f1016;\n        --card-bg: rgba(26, 28, 41, 0.95);\n        --accent-gold: #ffc857;\n        --accent-pink: #ff2a75;\n        --accent-cyan: #00f0ff;\n        --text-main: #ffffff;\n        --text-sub: #b3b3b3;\n\n        background-color: var(--bg-color);\n        background-image: \n            radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(255, 42, 117, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),\n            radial-gradient(circle at 90% 90%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%);\n        padding: 30px 15px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card {\n        background: var(--card-bg);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        max-width: 600px;\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 30px;\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n        color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .header {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .header h2 {\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\n        color: var(--accent-gold);\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .highlight-box {\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.1), rgba(255, 42, 117, 0.1));\n        border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);\n        padding: 12px 16px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        font-size: 1.0rem;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .section-title {\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\n        color: var(--accent-cyan);\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .highlights-list {\n        list-style: none;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .highlights-list li {\n        padding: 12px 15px;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .highlights-list .label {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .highlights-list .value {\n        color: var(--accent-gold);\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .cta-container {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .btn-booking {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 15px 0;\n        background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-pink), #ff5e3a);\n        color: #fff;\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        border-radius: 50px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 42, 117, 0.4);\n        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .btn-booking:hover {\n        transform: translateY(-2px);\n        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 42, 117, 0.6);\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .info-block {\n        border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n        padding-top: 20px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .info-item {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .info-item .title {\n        color: var(--text-sub);\n        width: 90px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .info-item .content {\n        color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .info-item .content a {\n        color: var(--accent-cyan);\n        text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .notice-block {\n        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        font-size: 0.85rem;\n        color: #888;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .notice-block p {\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .notice-block p:last-child {\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .ktv-promo-card .warning-text {\n        color: #ff5555;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n        .ktv-promo-card {\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        .ktv-promo-card .header h2 {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n        }\n        .ktv-promo-card .highlights-list li {\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ktv-promo-container\">\n    <div class=\"ktv-promo-card\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h2>🍺 下班開唱預備起！<br>【平日限時微醺方案】</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n            忙了一整天，該來放鬆一下了吧！小包廂歡唱 4 小時只要 <strong>$1,800</strong>，事先預約直接送你一整柱 <strong>3L 柏克金啤酒</strong>，還有美食自助吧吃到飽！\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">\n            🔥 方案亮點\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"highlights-list\">\n            <li>\n                <span class=\"label\">平日微醺專屬</span>\n                <span class=\"value\">17:00 - 20:00 限時入場</span>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <span class=\"label\">包廂歡唱 4H</span>\n                <span class=\"value\">$1,800（基本 5 人包廂）</span>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <span class=\"label\">提前預約就送</span>\n                <span class=\"value\">柏克金啤酒柱 (3L) *1</span>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <span class=\"label\">美食吃到飽</span>\n                <span class=\"value\">豐富自助吧無限享用</span>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <span class=\"label\">揪團更划算</span>\n                <span class=\"value\">第 6 人起，每人只要 +$300</span>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <div class=\"cta-container\">\n            <a href=\"https://reurl.cc/LN0G39\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-booking\">👉 點我立即線上訂位</a>\n        </div>\n\n           <div class=\"notice-block\">\n            <p class=\"warning-text\">⚠️ 未滿18歲請勿飲酒｜禁止酒駕，安全有保障</p>\n            <p>⚠️ 自助吧限內用且無提供酒類</p>\n            <p>⚠️ 自帶酒類不收取開瓶費</p>\n            <p>⚠️ 本活動不適用 四大情境優惠</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- 美樂地 KTV 優惠方案區段 結束 -->"
